# hostname -> backend, read at request time by fe_partner.
#
# This file is the routing table. Nothing in haproxy.cfg says where
# partner-a.example.com goes, and a reader of the configuration alone cannot
# know — which is exactly why nagipath reports the route as undetermined instead
# of resolving it. The map is captured as text; it is not interpreted.
partner-a.example.com   be_app
partner-b.example.com   be_partner_dynamic
legacy.example.com      be_maintenance
